    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of September 29, 2017\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 02.10.2017)\n\nTHAREEQATHUL AROOSIYYATHILQAADHIRIYYAH ASSOCIATION OF SRI LANKA(INCORPORATION)\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nto incorporate the Thareeqathul Aroosiyyathil QaadhiriyyahAssociation of Sri Lanka\n\nTo be presented in Parliament by Hon. Seyed Ali Zahir Moulana, M.P. forBatticaloa District\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 23.00Postage : Rs. 10.00\n\n(Private Member\u2019s Bill)\n\n1Thareeqathul Aroosiyyathil QaadhiriyyahAssociation of Sri Lanka (Incorporation)\n\n2\u2014PL 005432 \u2014 300 (09/2017)\n\nPreamble.\n\nShort title.\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE THAREEQATHUL AROOSIYYATHILQAADHIRIYYAH ASSOCIATION OF SRI LANKA\n\nWHEREAS His Holiness Qutbuz Zaman Madihus SibtainAl- Allama As-Shaikh Imamul Aroos Sayyid MuhammadMapillai Lebbai Alim Waliyullah has established, foundedand maintained several Mosques, Thakkiyas, Madrasas,Charitable Trusts, Muslim Shrines and Places of Religiousresort and other institutions in Sri Lanka:\n\nAND WHEREAS His Holiness Qutbuz Zaman MadihusSibtain Al- Allama As-Shaikh Imamul Aroos SayyidMuhammad Mapillai Lebbai Alim Waliyullah formed anAssociation called the Thareeqathul AroosiyyathilQaadhiriyyah Association in Sri Lanka and abroad for thepurpose of effectually carrying out the objects andtransacting all matters connected with the said Associationaccording to the practices, rites, customs and rules laid downby the said Spiritual Head and agreed by its members :\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Association has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was established and has applied tobe incorporated and it will be for the public advantage togrant the said application :\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014"
