    "chunk_text": "AND WHEREAS the said Association has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was established and has applied tobe incorporated and it will be for the public advantage togrant the said application :\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n2.(1) There shall be constituted a body corporate(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cCorporation \u201d) with perpetualsuccession under the name and style of the \u201cThareeqathulAroosiyyathil Qaadhiriyyah Association in Sri Lanka\u201d fromand after the date of this Act comes into operation and by\n\nIncorporationof theThareeqathulAroosiyyathilQaadhiriyyahAssociationin Sri Lanka.30\n\n2Thareeqathul Aroosiyyathil QaadhiriyyahAssociation of Sri Lanka (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nthat name may sue and be sued with full power and authorityto have and use a common seal and to alter the same at itspleasure.\n\n(2) From and after the date of commencement of this Act,members of the Thareeqathul Aroosiyyathil QaadhiriyyahAssociation of Sri Lanka (hereinafter referred to as the\u201cAssociation\u201d) shall hereinafter continue as members of theCorporation.\n\n(3) From and after the date of commencement of this Act,the list of institutions vested with the Association includingthose institutions set out in the First Schedule to this Actshall hereinafter be vested with the Corporation.\n\n(4) Any property, right or thing vested, belonging,dedicated or associated with the Spiritual Head orAssociation from and after the date of commencement ofthis Act, shall be vested with the Corporation.\n\n3.The general objects of the Corporation are herebydeclared to be\u2014"
