    "chunk_text": "(2) The Corporation shall also have the power to institutelegal proceedings in respect of any property claimed to beowned, possessed, belonging to , dedicated or associatedwith or managed for and on behalf of the Founding SpiritualHead, Association or Corporation as the case may be.30\n\nGeneralPowers of theCorporation.\n\n5Thareeqathul Aroosiyyathil QaadhiriyyahAssociation of Sri Lanka (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n(2) The Spiritual Head of the Corporation shall be theLife Patron of the Corporation as long as he continues to besuch Spiritual Head.\n\n(3) At the coming into operation of this Act, His HolinessAs-Shaikh Afdhalul Ulama Dr. Thaika Shuaib Alim, B.A.(Hons)., M.A., ph. D., M.F.A, Jalali, the present OfficiatingShaikh of the Association shall be the Spiritual Head of theCorporation and shall hold office for life.\n\n(4) The Spiritual Head shall have full power and authorityin his discretion to nominate a successor. Such nominationshall be in accordance with the rules and will become operativeupon the death or incapacity of the incumbent Spiritual Head.The Spiritual Head may in his absolute discretion delegateany of his powers and functions to such persons as he maythink fit and for such period as may be prescribed by him.Notwithstanding any delegation of any such powers orfunctions, the Spiritual Head may at any time exercise anysuch powers or functions delegated or revoke such delegationwithout notice to the person or persons to whom such powersor functions has been delegated.\n\n(5) The successors to the Spiritual Head shall indescending order be\u2014\n\n(i)His Holiness As-Shaikh Afzalul Ulama Ahmad NasirThaika Shuaib also known as Thaika Nasir AlimJalali, B.A. (His.), M.F.A., Faazil Jamaali, andthereafter shall be;\n\n(ii)His Holiness As-Shaikh Yaseen Mujeerudeen alsoknown as Thaika Mujeerudeen Alim Jalali., B.A.(Bus. Studies) U.K., Al-Azhari, and thereafter shallbe;\n\n30\n\nManagementof the affairsof theCorporation