    "chunk_size_bytes": 1880,
    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of September 08, 2017\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 11.09.2017)\n\nURBAN COUNCILS (AMENDMENT)\n\nOrdered to be published by the Minister of Provincial Councils andLocal Government\n\nto amend the Urban Councils Ordinance (Chapter 255)\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 10.00\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nSTATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT\n\nClause 2 : This clause replaces section 5 of the Urban Councils Ordinance (Chapter 255)and the legal effect of the new section as replaced is to amend the composition of theUrban Councils.\n\n1Urban Councils (Amendment)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n2\u2014PL 005435\u2014475 (09/2017)\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 50/2017\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE URBAN COUNCILS ORDINANCE(CHAPTER 255)\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Urban Councils(Amendment) Act, No. of 2017.\n\n2.Section 5 of the Urban Councils Ordinance (Chapter255) is hereby repealed and the following section substitutedtherefor:\u2014\n\n5.(1) Each Urban Council shall consist ofsuch number of Councillors\u2014\n\n(a)as specified by the Minister by Orderpublished in the Gazette, based onthe Orders published under sections3C and 3D of the Local AuthoritiesElections Ordinance (Chapter 262);\n\n(b)equivalent to forty per centum of thenumber of Councillors as specifiedby the Minister by Order made underparagraph (a), who shall be returnedin terms of section 65B of the LocalAuthorities Elections Ordinance(Chapter 262); and\n\n(c)determined by the Commissionerunder paragraph (a) of subsection (4)of section 65B of the LocalAuthorities Elections Ordinance(Chapter 262).\n\nShort title.\n\nReplacementof section 5of Chapter255.\n\n\u201cCompositionof UrbanCouncils.\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nUrban Councils (Amendment)2"
  },
