    "chunk_text": "2.From and after the date of commencement of this Act,such and so many persons as presently are members ofSukyo Mahikari Sri Lanka\u201d (hereinafter referred to as \u201ctheFoundation\u201d) or shall hereafter be admitted as members ofthe Corporation hereby constituted, shall be a body corporate(hereinafter referred to as \u201cthe Corporation\u201d) with perpetualsuccession under the name and style of the \u201cSukyo MahikariSri Lanka\u201d, and by that name may sue and be sued in allCourts, with full power and authority to have and use acommon seal and alter the same at its pleasure.\n\n3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be\u2014\n\nShort title.\n\nIncorporationof SukyoMahikari SriLanka.\n\nGeneralobjects of theCorporation.\n\n10\n\nPreamble.\n\n5\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\n2\u2014PL 005337 - 300 (07/2017)\n\nSukyo Mahikari Sri Lanka(Incorporation)2\n\n(b) to give Divine Light (True Light) to its own membersand other members of the general public;\n\n(c) to have close contacts and obtain guidances fromMahikari Centres in other countries and to establishofficial centres Islandwide;\n\n(d) to establish and maintain affiliation with SukyoMahikari, japan;\n\n(e) to publish articles, periodicals or other suchliterature and information as may be seen necessaryor useful to serve the objects of the Foundation;\n\n(f) to provide the welfare of persons employed by theFoundation as required by law;\n\n(g) to set up and promote Yoko Farming (OrganicSpiritual Farming); and\n\n(h) to take all other steps as are necessary or desirable forthe promotion of the above mentioned objects."
