    "chunk_text": "(f) to provide the welfare of persons employed by theFoundation as required by law;\n\n(g) to set up and promote Yoko Farming (OrganicSpiritual Farming); and\n\n(h) to take all other steps as are necessary or desirable forthe promotion of the above mentioned objects.\n\n10\n\n5\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nPowers of theCorporation.\n\n30\n\n3Sukyo Mahikari Sri Lanka(Incorporation)\n\n5.(1) The management of the affairs of the Corporationshall be subject to the rules of the Corporation, beadministerd by a Board of Directors consisting of Chairman,Vice Chairman, Secretary, Treasurer and up to three Directors,as deemed necessary.\n\n(2) The Spiritual Leader of Sukyo Mahikari, Japan shallbe the Governing Director of the Corporation and he/sheshall appoint the Chairman of the Corporation.\n\n(3) The first Board of Directors of the Foundation shall bethe Board of Directors of the Corpoation holding office onthe day proceeding the date of commencement of this Act.\n\n6.(1) It shall be lawful for the Corporation from time totime at any Meeting of the Corporation and by a majority ofnot less than two-thirds of the members of the Boardof Directors including the Chairman and the SecretaryPresent and voting to make rules, not inconsistent with theprovisions of this Act or any other written law, for thefollowing matters:\u2014\n\n(a)the admission, classification of membership,withdrawal or expulsion of members;\n\n(b)for the election of office bearers, the resignationfrom, or vacation of, or removal from office of officebearers, remuneration of office bearers and theirpowers, conduct and duties;\n\n(c)the election of the members of the Board of Directorsother than the Chairman with the consent of theSpiritual Leader;\n\n(d)the determination of the powers, conduct and dutiesand the terms of office of the members of the Boardof Directors;\n\n(e)the powers, conduct, duties and functions of thevarious officers, agents and servants of theCorporation;\n\n10\n\n5\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\nManagementof the affairsof theCorporation.\n\nRules of theCorporation."
