f 2016 ishereby further amended as follows:-\n\n(1)in Part I of that Schedule-\n\n(a)in item (iv) thereof, by the deletion of sub-item (iv) and substitution therefor of thefollowing:-\n\n\u201c(iv) any other similar purpose,"
