    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of May 19, 2017\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 22.05.2017)\n\nABDUL MAJEED ACADEMY (INCORPORATION)\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nto incorporate the Abdul Majeed Academy\n\nTo be presented in Parliament by Hon. K. Kader Masthan, M.P. forVanni District\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5.\n\nPrice : Rs. 8.00Postage : Rs. 10.00\n\n(Private Member\u2019s Bill)\n\nAbdul Majeed Academy(Incorporation)1\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE ABDUL MAJEED ACADEMY\n\nWHEREAS an Academy called and known as the\u201cAbdul Majeed Academy\u201d has heretofore been formed in SriLanka for the purpose of effectually carrying out its objectsand transacting all matters connected with the said Academyaccording to the rules agreed to by its members:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Academy has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was established, and has applied tobe incorporated and it will be expedient to grant the saidapplication :\n\nBE it therefore, enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Abdul Majeed Academy(Incorporation) Act, No. of 2017.\n\n2.(1) From and after the date of commencement of thisAct, such and so may persons as now are members of the \u201cAbdulMajeed Academy\u201d (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cAcademy\u201d) orshall hereafter be admitted as members of the Corporation herebyconstituted, shall be a body corporate with perpetual succession,under the name and style of the \u201cAbdul Majeed Academy\u201d,(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cCorporation\u201d) and by that namemay sue and be sued, with full power and authority to have anduse a common seal and to alter the same at its pleasure."
