    "chunk_text": "BE it therefore, enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Hector AppuhamyHelping Hand Charity Foundation (Incorporation) Act,No. of 2017.\n\nPreamble.\n\nShort title.\n\nIncorporationof the HectorAppuhamyHelpingHand CharityFoundation.\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n2Hector Appuhamy Helping Hand Charity Foundation (Incorporation)\n\n3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be\u2014\n\n(a)to provide medical aid and food to the poor, thedestitute and the sick;\n\n(b)to conduct special services for needy school childrenand to offer assistance by way of scholarships, libraryfacilities and other necessary educational supportfor students;\n\n(c)to conduct classes for the students sitting for yearfive scholarship, GCE (O/L) and GCE (A/L)examinations by experts in the particular field ofeducation;\n\n(d)to support and encourage the services provided bysenior citizens\u2019 organizations;\n\n(e)to develop pre-schools for early childhooddevelopment of the needy children;\n\n(f)to give aid by way of scholarships to any officer orservants engaged in the furtherance of the objectsof the Corporation;\n\n(g)to promote understanding, co-operation andfriendship with similar institutions within andoutside Sri Lanka;\n\n(h)to organize employees of small and medium scaleindustries and enterprise services and workingtowards their future advancement;\n\n(i)to initiate and implement economic, social, culturaland environmental development activities inSri Lanka and providing guidance necessary for it;\n\n(j)to combat waste and corruption and utilize allresources belonging to our community in a veryuseful manner;\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nGeneralobjects of theCorporation.\n\n30\n\n3Hector Appuhamy Helping Hand Charity Foundation (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\n(k)to design and implement social mobilizationprogrammes for the development of children andwomen and implementing education and trainingprogrammes for this purpose;"
  },
