    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 174]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by Hon. Nalaka Prasad Colonne, M. P. forPolonnaruwa District on 06th April, 2017\n\n(Published in the Gazette on March 20, 2017)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 11.00Postage : Rs. 10.00\n\n2-2d\n\n2-\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nINSTITUTION OF BUILDING SERVICESENGINEERING & TECHNOLOGY OF SRI LANKA\n\n(INCORPORATION)\n\nto incorporate the Institution of Building ServicesEngineering & Technology of Sri Lanka\n\n2\u2014PL 005148\u2014225 (04/2017)\n\n1Institution of Building Services Engineering &Technology of Sri Lanka (Incorporation)\n\nPreamble.\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n2\u2014PL 005062\u2014300 (03/2017)\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE INSTITUTION OF BUILDING SERVICESENGINEERING & TECHNOLOGY OF SRI LANKA\n\nWHEREAS an Institution called and known as the\u201cInstitution of Building Services Engineering & Technologyof Sri Lanka\u201d has heretofore been established in Sri Lankafor the purpose of effectually carrying out and transactingall objects and matters connected with the said Institutionaccording to the rules agreed to by its members:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Institution has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the objects andmatters for which it was formed and has applied to beincorporated and it will be for the public advantage to grantsuch application:\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Institution of BuildingServices Engineering & Technology of Sri Lanka(Incorporation) Act, No. of 2017."
  },
