    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of February 23, 2017\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 27.02.2017)\n\nASSOCIATION OF TRADITIONAL OFFICIALS OF THEALL ISLAND HISTORICAL DEVALA(INCORPORATION)\n\nBILL\n\nto incorporate the Association of Traditional Officials of the All IslandHistorical Devala\n\nPrice : Rs. 8.00Postage : Rs. 10.00\n\nA\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nTo be presented in Parliament by Hon. (Dr.) Thusitha Wijemanne,M. P. for Kegalle District\n\n1Association of Traditional Officials of the All IslandHistorical Devala (Incorporation)\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE ASSOCIATION OF TRADITIONALOFFICIALS OF THE ALL ISLAND HISTORICAL DEVALA\n\nWHEREAS an Association called and known as the\u201cAssociation of Traditional Officials of the All IslandHistorical Devala\u201d has heretofore been established in SriLanka for the purpose of effectually carrying out it objectsand transacting all matters connected with the saidAssocaition according to the rules agreed to by the members:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Association has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was established and has applied tobe incorporated and it will be for the public advantage togrant the said application:\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Association ofTraditional Officials of the All Island Historical Devala(Incorporation) Act, No. of 2017."
  },
