    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of February 17, 2017\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 20.02.2017)\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\n(Private Member\u2019s Bill)\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 8.00Postage : Rs. 10.00\n\nHECTOR APPUHAMY HELPING HANDCHARITY FOUNDATION (INCORPORATION)\n\nTo be presented in Parliament by Hon. Anura Sidney Jayarathne, M.P. forPolonnaruwa District\n\nto incorporate the Hector Appuhamy Helping Hand Charity Foundation\n\n1Hector Appuhamy Helping Hand Charity Foundation (Incorporation)\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE HECTOR APPUHAMY HELPINGHAND CHARITY FOUNDATION\n\nWHEREAS a Foundation called and known as the\u201cHector Appuhamy Helping Hand Charity Foundation\u201dheretofore been formed in Sri Lanka for the purpose ofeffectually carrying out its objects and transacting all mattersconnected with the said Foundation according to the rulesagreed by its members:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Foundation has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted several objects andmatters for which it was established, and has applied to beincorporated, and it will be expedient to grant the saidapplication:\n\nBE it therefore, enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Hector AppuhamyHelping Hand Charity Foundation (Incorporation) Act,No. of 2017."
