    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 160]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by Hon. (Dr.) Ramesh Pathirana, M. P. for Galle Districton 08th February, 2017\n\n(Published in the Gazette on January 09, 2017)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 8.00Postage : Rs. 10.00\n\n2-2d\n\n2-\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nINTERNATIONAL WOMEN\u2019S AND CHILDREN\u2019SRIGHTS COUNCIL (IWCRC) (INCORPORATION)\n\nto incorporate the International Women\u2019s and Children\u2019s Rights Council\n\n1International Women\u2019s and Children\u2019sRights Council (IWCRC) (Incorporation)\n\n2\u2014PL 005023\u2014 225 (02/2017)\n\nPreamble.\n\nShort title.\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE INTERNATIONAL WOMEN\u2019S ANDCHILDREN\u2019S RIGHTS COUNCIL (IWCRC)\n\nWHEREAS a Council called and known as the \u201cInternationalWomen\u2019s and Children\u2019s Rights Council (IWCRC)\u201d hasheretofore been established in Sri Lanka for the purpose ofeffectually carrying out its objects and transacting all mattersconnected with the said Council according to the rulesagreed to by its members:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Council has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was established and has applied tobe incorporated and it will be for the public advantage togrant such application:\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the International Women\u2019sand Children\u2019s Rights Council (IWCRC) (Incorporation)Act, No. of 2017."
