    "chunk_text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the International Women\u2019sand Children\u2019s Rights Council (IWCRC) (Incorporation)Act, No. of 2017.\n\nIncorporationof theInternationalWomen\u2019sandChildren\u2019sRightsCouncil(IWCRC).\n\n2International Women\u2019s and Children\u2019sRights Council (IWCRC) (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\n(2) The Corporation shall be deemed to be a VoluntarySocial Service Organization within the meaning, and for thepurpose of the Voluntary Social Services Organizations(Registration of the Supervision) Act, No. 31 of 1980 andthe provisions of that Act shall apply to and in relation tothe management of the affairs of the Corporation.\n\n3.(1) The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be:\u2014\n\n(a)to safeguard, protect and promte the rights ofwomen and children everywhere within thebroad perspective of the protection of HumanRights;\n\n(b)to support and uplift the lives of mothers andchildren who are victims of social injusticesand disabilities;\n\n(c)to prevent the occurrence of all forms of abuse,violence and crimes against women andchildren;\n\n(d)to assist needy school children financially orotherwise by way of donations, prizes andscholarships enabling them to continue theireducation and encourage their regularattendance at school and to assist them in theireducational and other development activities;\n\n(e)to provide shelter and safe house facilities tomothers and children of disrupted families andimplement programmes for their well beingincluding family reunion; and\n\n(f)to do all such other acts, matters and things asare incidental or conducive to the attainmentof the objectives of the Corporation.\n\nGeneralobjects of theCorporation.\n\n3International Women\u2019s and Children\u2019sRights Council (IWCRC) (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30"
