(3) of section 43A\u201d;\n\n(2)in subsection (1A) by the repeal of paragraph (c)thereof and the substitution therefor of the followingparagraphs:\u2014\n\n\u201c(c)has passed the special examinationprescribed in that behalf by the MedicalCouncil; and"
