    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nSATHYA SRI GHANAPATHI BHAKTHI JANASEWA FOUNDATION (INCORPORATION)\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 132]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by Hon. Ananda Kumarasiri, M. P. for Moneragala Districton 23rd August, 2016\n\n(Published in the Gazette on July 25, 2016)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\nto incorporate the Sathya Sri Ghanapathi BhakthiJana Sewa Foundation\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 8.00Postage : Rs. 10.00\n\n2-2d\n\n2-\n\n2\u2014PL 010152\u2014225 (08/2016)\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n1Sathya Sri Ghanapathi Bhakthi Jana Sewa Foundation (Incorporation)\n\nPreamble.\n\nShort title.\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE SATHYA SRI GHANAPATHI BHAKTHIJANA SEWA FOUNDATION\n\nWHEREAS a society called and known as the \u201cSathya SriGhanapathi Bhakthi Jana Sewa Foundation\u201d has heretoforebeen established in Sri Lanka for the purpose of effectuallycarrying out its objects and transacting all matters connectedwith the said society according to the rules agreed to by themembers:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said society has heretofore successfullycarried out and transacted the several objects and matters forwhich it was established and has applied to be incorporatedand it will be for the public advantage to grant the saidapplication.\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:-\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Sathya Sri GhanapathiBhakthi Jana Sewa Foundation (Incorporation) Act, No. of2016."
  },
