    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPresented by the Minister of Higher Education and Highwayson 21st July, 2016\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 10.00\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 124]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n(Published in the Gazette on April 18, 2016)\n\n2\u2014PL 010094\u2014475 (07/2016)\n\nUNIVERSITIES (AMENDMENT)\n\nto amend the Universities Act, No. 16 of 1978\n\n1Universities (Amendment)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\nShort title.\n\nL. D.\u2014O. 35/2013.\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE UNIVERSITIESACT, NO. 16 OF 1978\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Universities(Amendment) Act, No. of 2016.\n\n2.Section 75 of the Universities Act, No. 16 of 1978(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) is herebyrepealed and the following new section is substitutedtherefor:\u2014\n\n75. (1) The retirement age of a public officeras may be determined by the Government, fromtime to time, shall apply with effect from thesame date as applicable to a public officer inrespect of the retirement age of the holder ofany post, other than that of a teacher.\n\n(2) (a) the Commission or the governingauthority of any Higher EducationalInstitution to which the holder of such post isattached or in the case where such person isattached to a Higher Educational Institute, thegoverning authority of the Higher EducationalInstitution to which such institute is affiliatedmay based on the recommendations of theInstitute suspend the holder of such postpending an inquiry by the Commission or suchgoverning authority or the Institute, as the casemay be, for misconduct, inefficiency ordereliction of duty; or\n\nReplacementof section 75of Act, No.16 of 1978.\n\n20\n\n\u201cRetirementof personsother thanteachers.\n\n25\n\n2Universities (Amendment)"
