    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of July 08, 2016\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 11.07.2016)\n\nLASALLIAN COMMUNITY EDUCATION SERVICES(INCORPORATION)\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nto incorporate the Lasallian Community Education Services\n\nTo be presented in Parliament by Hon. K. K. Piyadasa, M.P. forNuwera-Eliya District\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5.\n\nPrice : Rs. 8.00Postage : Rs. 10.00\n\n(Private Member\u2019s Bill)\n\nLasallian Community Education Services(Incorporation)1\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n2\u2014PL 010027\u2014300 (06/2016)\n\n20\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE LASALLIAN COMMUNITYEDUCATION SERVICES\n\nWHEREAS an organization called and known as the\u201cLasallian Community Education Services \u201d has heretoforebeen established in Sri Lanka for the purpose of effectuallycarrying out and transacting all objects and matters connectedwith the said organization according to the rules agreed toby its members:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said organization has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was established and has applied tobe incorporated and it will be for the public advantage togrant the application:\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Lasallian CommunityEducation Services (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2016."
