    "chunk_text": "subsection (5) and the legal effect of the amendment is to prohibit the issue of a Certificate\n\nof Death in respect of a missing person prior to cancellation of a Certificate of Absence.\n\nClause 8 : This clause inserts a new section 7A and the legal effect of the section as\n\nwith the decision of the Registrar-General.\n\nClause 9 : This clause amends section 8 of the principal enactment and is consequential\n\nto the amendment made to the Schedule.\n\nClause 10 : This clause inserts a new Part 1A in the principal enactment and the new\n\npart provides for the registration of persons missing due to the conflict in the Northern and\n\nEastern Provinces, political unrest or civil disturbances or enforced disappearances and\n\nthe issuance of a certificate of absence to the relative of the missing person.\n\nClause 11 : This clause amends section 10 of the principal enactment and is consequential\n\nto the amendment made to the Schedule.\n\nClause 12 : This clause repeals section 14 of the principal enactment and is consequential\n\nto the operation of Parts 1 and 1A.\n\nClause 13 : This clause amends section 15 of the principal enactment and the legal\n\neffect of the section as amended is to extend the provisions relating to offences and\n\npenalties.\n\nClause 14 : This clause amends section 17 of the principal enactment by the insertion\n\nof new definitions for the words \u201cMinister\u201d and \u201crelative\u201d.\n\nClause 15 : This clause amends the schedule to the principal enactment by inclusion of\n\nthe new Forms \u201cB\u201d and \u201cC\u201d. Form B specifies the format of application for registration\n\nof a missing person and for the issue of a certificate of Absence. Form C specifies the\n\nformat of certificate of Absence.\n\n1Registration of Deaths (Temporary Provisions)\n\n(Amendment)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n2\u2014PL 009996\u2014425 (06/2016)\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 41/2015.\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE REGISTRATION OF DEATHS (TEMPORARYPROVISIONS) ACT, NO. 19 OF 2010\n\nBe it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:-"
