    "md5": "5bb867aa3ecdd46ca4a7c2871e15c7c1",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1805,
    "chunk_text": "AND WHEREAS the said Foundation has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was formed and has applied to beincorporated and it will be for the public advantage to grantsuch application:\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Janakaraliya CulturalFoundation (Incorporation) Act, No. 2016.\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n2Janakaraliya Cultural Foundation(Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be\u2014\n\n(a)to build awareness amongst the people of everystrata about the importance of cultural and spiritualdevelopment parallel to the material developmentand the importance and possibility of the usage ofdrama and theatre and other arts as supportivehuman activites within that integral development,to build a sensitive, creative, wise and activesociety;\n\n(b)to provide access for the majority of people in thecountry to theatre of performance without anyethnic, socio-cultural or political discrimination,by broadening the usage of it and motivating themthrough various methods to participate in dramaand theatre and arts;\n\n(c)to use and support to sue drama and theatre andother arts to enable majority of society tounderstand and build self esteem, whileundrstanding tolerating, appreciating, admiringothers and their various ideologies, inclinations,behaviours, cultures that enable them tocommunicate and interact with each othereffectively and as a result support building a societyin which everybody can live in harmony and peace;\n\n(d)to support to create a society to understand thenature and build a good relationship with the naturethat enables living in harmony with nature;"
  },
