    "chunk_text": "Power of theCorporation.25\n\n30\n\nSri Lanka Association for Child Development(SLACD) (Incorporation)8\n\nTwo non-voting members shall represent the Sri LankaCollege of Paediatricians, College of Community Physicians.\n\n(4) Council Members shall be elected for a two (2) yearterm. At the end of the term in office, no person shall succeedthemselves to the same office of the Council.\n\n(5) Any candidate for office must have been a member ofSLACD for at least two (2) years.\n\n(6) Any of the Council Members may be removed fromoffice by a majority vote of the Council at any meeting. Inthe event that any one or more of the elected Council Membersmay be so removed new Council Members may be electedat the same meeting to fill the unexpired terms of the CouncilMember so removed.\n\n(7) Any vacancies of the Council Members may be filledby the remaining Council Members at an annual or specialmeeting of the Council as provided in these by-laws. Avacancy may be filled only for the unexpired protion of itsterm.\n\n(8) The Council of the SLACD shall meet at least onceevery two months. Such meeting shall be held for thetransaction of such business as may properly come before themeeting. Any other meeting of the Council shall be held atsuch time and place as may be designated by the President.At least 14 days advance notice in writing of time and placeof this meeting shall be given to each Member of the Council.\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\n9Sri Lanka Association for Child Development(SLACD) (Incorporation)\n\n(9) A quorum to transact business shall consist of a majorityof the Council Members of the SLACD then in office. Everyact or decision of a majority of the Council Members presentat a duly held meeting at which a quorum is present, made ordone when assembled, shall be vaild as an act of the Council."
