    "chunk_text": "(13) Written notice of the time and place of meetings ofthe Council shall be delivered to each Council Member ofthe SLACD personally or by mail or other form of writtencommunication, charges prepaid, addressed to him either athis address as it is shown on the Register of the SLACD, or ifit is not shown on such records or is not readily ascertainable,to the place at which the meetings of the Council is regularlyheld. Such notice shall be delivered at least 72 hoursprior to the time of the holding of the meeting.\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\n35\n\nSri Lanka Association for Child Development(SLACD) (Incorporation)10\n\n(15) All officers shall be elected at the Annual GeneralMeeting by a majority vote of the genenral membership ofthe SLACD.\n\n(16) None of the SLACD officers are eligible for re-electionto succeed themselves to the same office. The President electwill succeed the President.\n\nThe SLACD President shall be the Chief Executive Officerand, subject to the supervisions of the Council of the SLACD,shall have general supervision and direction of the businessand affairs. The President shall preside at all meetings of theCouncil of the SLACD and shall have such other duties andresponsibilities as may from time to time be determined bythe Council. The President may permit any and all sharesheld by the SLACD in any other corporation. He or she shallbe an ex-officio and a voting Member of all standingcommittees and shall have the general powers and duties asmay be specified by the Council, or by these by-laws. ThePresident should possess and MD or PhD.\n\n(17) In the absence of the President, or in the event of hisor her inability to act, the Vice President shall perform theduties of the President and, when so acting, shall have all thepowers of and be subject to all the restrictions upon thePresident. The Vice President should possess and MD or PhD.\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\n11Sri Lanka Association for Child Development(SLACD) (Incorporation)\n\nThe Secretary shall\u2014"
