    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nUNITED CHRISTIAN FELLOWSHIP OFSRI LANKA (INCORPORATION)\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 105]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by Hon. Buddhika Pathirana M. P. for Matara District on 04th May, 2016\n\n(Published in the Gazette on February 26, 2016)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nto incorporate the United Christian Fellowship of Sri Lanka\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA.\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5.\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 10.00\n\n2-2d\n\n2-\n\n2-PL 009919 \u2014225 (05/2016)\n\n1United Christian Fellowship of Sri Lanka(Incorporation)\n\nShort title.\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n2\u2014PL 009759\u2014 300 (02/2016)\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE UNITED CHRISTIAN FELLOWSHIP\n\nOF SRI LANKA\n\nWHEREAS an association called and known as the\u201cUnited Christian Fellowship\u201d has heretofore beenestablished in Sri Lanka for the puropse of effectually carryingout and transacting all matters connected with the saidassociation:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said association has heretoforesuecessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was established and had applied tobe incorporated by Act of Parliament, and it will be for thepublic advantage to grant the application.\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the United ChristianFellowship of Sri Lanka (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2016."
  },
  {
    "doc_type": "lk_bills",
    "doc_id": "2016-05-04-2016-05-04-15-2016-en",
    "num": "2016-05-04-15-2016-en",
    "date_str": "2016-05-04",
    "description": "United Christian Fellowship of Sri Lanka (Incorporation) - Bill",
    "url_metadata": "https://documents.gov.lk/view/bills/bl_2016.html",
