    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nAL-JAMIATHUL GHAWSIYYAH(INCORPORATION)\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 101]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by Hon. K. Kader Masthan M.P. for Vanni Districton 07th April, 2016\n\n(Published in the Gazette on February 29, 2016)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nto incorporate the Al-Jamiathul Ghawsiyyah\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 10.00\n\n2-2d\n\n2-\n\n2-PL 009890 \u2014 225 (04/2016)\n\n1Al-Jamiathul Ghawsiyyah (Incorporation)\n\n2\u2014PL 009706\u2014300 (02/2016)\n\nPreamble.\n\nShort title.\n\nIncorporationof theAl-JamiathulGhawsiyyah.\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE AL-JAMIATHUL GHAWSIYYAH\n\nWHEREAS an Institute called and known as the \u201cAl-Jamiathul Ghawsiyyah \u201d has heretofore been established byHis Holiness Assaiyyidh Asseikh Abdur Rasheed KoyaThangal Al-Qadhiriyyah Wa, - Refaiyyah devoted genuineservices for Islam and for the purpose of effectually carryingout and transacting all objects and matters connected withthe said Institute according to the rules agreed to by HisHoliness Assaiyyidh Asseikh Abdur Rasheed Koya ThangalAl-Qadhiriyyah Wa, - Refaiyyah:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Institute has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and administered smoothly theseveral objects and matters for which it was formed and hasapplied to be incorporated and it is for the public advantageto grant such application:\n\nBe it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Al-JamiathulGhawsiyyah (Incorporation) Act, No. 2016."
