    "md5": "12408733903ca3d2de26c92a6d6b163c",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 2038,
    "chunk_text": "AND WHEREAS the said Institute has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and administered smoothly theseveral objects and matters for which it was formed and hasapplied to be incorporated and it is for the public advantageto grant such application:\n\nBe it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Al-JamiathulGhawsiyyah (Incorporation) Act, No. 2016.\n\n3.The general objects for which the Corporation isestablished are hereby declared to be\u2014\n\n(a)to conduct classes to promote religious discoursesof the Holy Quran, Hadhees, Fiqhu and Hiflu;\n\nGeneralobjects of theCorporation.\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\n2Al-Jamiathul Ghawsiyyah (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n(b)to organize the teaching of Arabic grammar and thestudy of laws of Shafee, Hanafee, Hambali andMaliki Mazhahs;\n\n(c)to conduct and promote researches on the abovediscourses and learning of Quran by memory;\n\n(d)to conduct commemorative events of Holy ProphetMuhammad Sallallahu Alaihiwa Sallam and ofother leading saints as may be deemed relevant andnecessary;\n\n(e)to conduct research into the life history andactivities of the founder of the Qadhiriyyah ThareeqHis Holiness Quthbul Aqthab Ashheikh AssaiyyidMuhyiddeen Abdul Qadir Jeelani (QaddasallahuSirrahul Azeez) of other leading;\n\n(f)to conduct convocations for the award of certificatesfor students who complete the Moulavi courseand/or Hiflu course;\n\n(g)to conduct weekly Qadhiriyya Rathib and AnnualKanduri Feast;\n\n(h)to promote the study of Urudu and other languages;\n\n(i)to maintain the Madrasa library of Islamic Sciencesequipped with relevant books and promote thereading interest of the Madrasa students;\n\n(j)to conduct and promote the studies on the basicprinciples of Ahulus Sunnath Waljama\u2019ath throughthe above library and Madrasa ;\n\n(k)to equip the library with books to conductresearches to promote the Islam Religion and theThareeqas and Madrasa; and\n\n3Al-Jamiathul Ghawsiyyah (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30"
  },
