    "chunk_text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2013\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Bareerah Muslim LadiesArabic College (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2016.\n\n3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be:\u2013\n\n(a)to produce Islamic Theologists to lead thecommunity under the Islamic law of \"Shariaa\";\n\n(b)to protect Islam;\n\nPreamble.\n\nShort title.\n\nIncorporationof BareerahMuslimLadiesArabicCollege.\n\nGeneralobjects of theCorporation.\n\n30\n\n2Bareerah Muslim Ladies Arabic College (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n(c)to produce \"Hafidhs\" who have learnt the HolyQuran by heart;\n\n(d)to promote and foster unity within the Islamiccommunity and find solutions for problems of suchcommunity;\n\n(e)to promote the policies of \"Sunnath Wal Jamaath\"within the Islamic community;\n\n(f)Learning and Teaching Islam in Arabic Languageaccording to Al Quran and Al Hadhees;\n\n(g)Teaching Sinhala, Tamil, English and Urdulanguages;\n\n(h)Providing opportunity to students to study Islambased on the syllabus approved by the Ministry ofEducation and guiding the students to GCEOrdinary Level and GCE Advanced LevelExaminations;\n\n(i)Organizing and Conducting a separate unit for theSocial Welfare, Economic Development andEducational Improvement of Muslim Ladies;\n\n(j)to promote and foster the policies of the \"SunnathWal Jamaath\" based on holy propagation of\"Thableekh\" with the \"Fikh\" (concepts of the Schoolof Thought) laws of the \"Shafiee Madhhab\" and theBelief in \"Al Ashariya\" ; and\n\n(k)to do all such acts and things as are in the opinionof the Corporation connected to any of the aboveand beneficial to the growth of the College.\n\n3Bareerah Muslim Ladies Arabic College (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20"
