    "chunk_text": "7.All debts and liabilities of the college existing on theday preceding the date of commencement of this Act shallbe paid by the Corporation and debt due to and subscriptionsand contributions payable to the college on day shall bepaid to the Corporation for the purpose of this Act.\n\n9.The money and property of the Corporationwhensoever deriving shall be applied solely towards thepromotion of its objects as set forth herein, and no portionthereof shall be paid or transfrerred directly or indirectly byway of divident, loan, or otherwise howsoever by way ofprofit to the members of the Corporation :\n\nProvided however, that the provisions of this sectionshall not prohibit\u2014\n\n(a)the payment in good faith of reasonable and properremuneration to any officer or employee of theCorporation for any service rendered by him to theCorporation;\n\n(b)the payment of reasonable and proper rent forpremises let to the Corporation by any member ofthe Corporation or by any company of which amember of the Corporation is a shareholder; and\n\n(c)the reimbursment or repayment of reasonable andproper expenses incurred with the prior approval ofthe Board of Management by any member, officeror employee of the Corporation in the discharge orperformance of his function or duties or inpromotion of the objects of the Corporation.\n\nFund of theCorporation.\n\nCorporationmay hold anddispose ofpropertymovable andimmovable.\n\nDebts due byand payableto theCollege.\n\n5Naduathul Ulama Arabic College, Mutur(Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10.It shall be lawfull for the Corporation\u2014\n\n(a)to purchase, acquire, rent, construct or otherwiseobtain lands or buildings which may be required tothe purpose of the Corporation and which maylawfully be acquired for those purposes and to dealwith or dispose of the same, as if may deemexpedient, with a view to promoting the objects ofthe Corporation;"
