    "chunk_size_bytes": 1836,
    "chunk_text": "(l) to make, repeal, alter or amend Rules andRegulations defining the manner of managementof the corporation and all necessary-by-laws orordinance for the regulations and conduct of itsaffairs and the various branches of its activities;\n\n(n) to invest the moneys of the Corporation notimmediately required for its purposes in or uponsuch investments, securities or property as may bethought fit subject nevertheless to such conditionsas may for the time being be imposed or requiredby law;\n\n(o) to make, draw, accept, discount, negotiate, buy, selland issue bills of exchange, cheques, promissorynotes and other negotiable or transferableinstruments or securities;\n\n(p) to do all such other acts and things as may benecessary incidental or beneficial to fulfill andaccomplish the objects of the Corporation.\n\n5.(1) The management of the affairs of the Corporationshall be managed by a Committee of Management consistingof number of members not exceeding fifteen. It shall have aPresident, Vice President, administrative Secretary, Treasurerand such Officers and staff to perform such duties as theCorporation may determine.\n\nManagementof theactivities oftheCorporation.\n\n6Daya Sarana Development Foundation (Incorporation)\n\nPL 007773 Daya Sarana (G)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\n(2) The Founder Member Mr. Daya Dharmapala KilittuwaGamage, shall be the first President of the Committee ofManagement. Any casual vacancy occurring in theCommittee of Management shall be filled by the Committeeitself subject to ratification by the General Body at its verynext meeting. The quorum for a Committee of Managementshall be one third of the Members of the Committee.\n\n(3) The first Committee of Management of theCorporation shall be the Committee of Management of theFoundation holding office on the day preceding the date ofcommencement of this Act."
