    "chunk_size_bytes": 1903,
    "chunk_text": "BE it therefore, enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Institute ofEnvironmental Professionals, Sri Lanka (Incorporation) Act,No. of 2016.\n\n3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be :\u2014\n\n(a) to raise and uphold the dignity and reputation ofenvironmental professionals in Sri Lanka ;\n\nShort title.\n\nPreamble.\n\nIncorporationof Institute ofEnvironmentalProfessionals\u2019,Sri Lanka.\n\n25\n\n30\n\nGeneralobjects of theCorporation.\n\n2Institute of Environmentel Professionals,Sri Lanka (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n(b) to disseminate environmental knowledge to thepublic ; and\n\n(c) to conserve and enhance the natural and physicalenvironment of Sri Lanka.\n\n4.The Functions of the Corporation shall be\u2014\n\n(a) to foster communication between environmentalprofessional and policy makers and to assist inmaintaining a balance between social economic andenvironmental goals ;\n\n(b) to identify, assess and to enhance current knowledgeof environmental issues of national and globalinterest ;\n\n(c) to encourage and promote interdisciplinary researchwith a view towards increasing scientificunderstanding of environmental issue ;\n\n(d) to link with electronic online libraries and databasesto disseminate environmental information ;\n\n(e) to promote and to facilitate awareness onenvironmental issues and training of scientists andothers ;\n\n(f) to promote informed advocacy in environmentalaffairs ;\n\n(g) to provide an enabling platform to discussenvironmental and development related issues ; and\n\n(h) to encourage and to publish environmentalpublications.\n\nFunctions oftheCorporation.\n\nInstitute of Environmentel Professionals,Sri Lanka (Incorporation)3\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n5.Subject to the provisions of this Act and any otherwritten law, the Corporation shall have the power to :\u2014"
