    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of January 14, 2016\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 18.01.2016)\n\nGANEGAMA SRI INDASARA DHARMAYATHANASANRAKSHANA SABHAWA (INCORPORATION)\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nto incorporate the Ganegama Sri Indasara DharmayathanaSanrakshana Sabhawa\n\nTo be presented in Parliament by Hon. Mohan Priyadarshana De Silva,M. P. for Galle District\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5.\n\nPrice : Rs. 8.00Postage : Rs. 10.00\n\n(Private Member\u2019s Bill)\n\nGanegama Sri Indasara DharmayathanaSanrakshana Sabhawa (Incorporation)1\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE GANEGAMA SRI INDASARADHARMAYATHANA SANRAKSHANA SABHAWA\n\nWHEREAS an Association called and known as the\u201cGanegama Sri Indasara Dharmayathana SanrakshanaSabhawa\u201d has heretofore been established at Ganegama,Baddegama in Sri Lanka for the purpose of effectually carryingout and transacting all objects and matters connected to byits members:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Association has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and fulfilled the several objects andmatters for which it was established, and has applied to beincorporated, and it will be for the public advantage to grantsuch application:\n\nBE it therefore, enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Ganegama Sri IndasaraDharmayathana Sanrakshana Sabhawa (Incorporation) Act,No. of 2016."
  },
