    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nU. L. M. FAROOK FOUNDATION (INCORPORATION)\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 56]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by Hon. Sujith Sanjaya Perera, M. P. for Kegalle Districton 16th December, 2015\n\n(Published in the Gazette on November 30, 2015)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nto incorporate the U. L. M. Farook Foundation\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 8.00Postage : Rs. 10.00\n\n2-2d\n\n2-\n\n2-PL 009609\u2014225 (12/2015)\n\n1U. L. M. Farook Foundation(Incorporation)\n\n2\u2014PL 09418\u2014 300 (11/2015)\n\nPreamble.\n\nShort title.\n\nGeneralobjects of theCorporation.\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE U. L. M. FAROOK FOUNDATION\n\nWHEREAS An Association called and known as\u201cU. L. M. Farook \u201d has heretofore been formed in the purposeof effectually carrying out and transacting all objects andmatters connected with the said Foundation according tothe rules agreed to by its members :\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Association has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was formed and has applied to beincorporated and it will be for the public advantage to grantsuch application :\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the U. L. M. FarookFoundation (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2015."
