    "chunk_size_bytes": 2018,
    "chunk_text": "AND WHEREAS the said Association has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was formed and has applied to beincorporated and it will be for the public advantage to grantsuch application :\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the U. L. M. FarookFoundation (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2015.\n\n3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be\u2014\n\n(a)to promote peace, goodwill, understanding andcooperation among all communities and people ofSri Lanka;\n\nIncorporationof the U. L.M. FarookFoundation.\n\n2U. L. M. Farook Foundation(Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n(b)to give assistance, prizes and scholarships to needyschool children to enable them to continue theireducation, encourage them to attend schoolregularly, assist them in their educational, culturaland scientific activities and to establish permanentand mobile libraries ;\n\n(c)to promote and protect Human rights, Humanvalues, fundamental freedoms democracy andpluralism in Sri Lanka;\n\n(d)to promote sustainable development in rural andbackward areas by utilizing the natural resourcesthat is available in those areas;\n\n(e)to promote agricultural and fishery sectors byintroducing latest technologies to obtain maximumbenefits;\n\n(f)to establish information technology centres islandwide for the advancement of scientific studies anddevelopment of the country;\n\n(g)to strengthen the Institutes of higher studies,encourage research and scholarship for theadvancement of higher education;\n\n(h)to promote social and cultural activities forenriching differrent ethnicities and for integratingthe Sri Lankan communities;\n\n(i)to empower women, children and the marginalizedgroups such as persons with disabilities, the pooretc.;\n\n(j)to promote and encourage humanitarian, sports,literary, spiritual activities;\n\n3U. L. M. Farook Foundation(Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25"
