    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nKOTASARA PIYANGALA RAJAMAHA VIHARASTHADEVELOPMENT SOCIETY (INCORPORATION)\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPresented by Hon. Nalin Bandara Jayamaha M.P. forKurunegala District on December 15, 2015\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 8.00Postage : Rs. 10.00\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 53]\n\n(Published in the Gazette on November 30, 2015)\n\nto incorporate the Kotasara Piyangala Rajamaha ViharasthaDevelopment Society\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n1Kotasara Piyangala Rajamaha ViharasthaDevelopment Society (Incorporation)\n\nPreamble.\n\nShort title.\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE KOTASARA PIYANGALA RAJAMAHAVIHARASTHA DEVELOPMENT SOCIETY\n\nWHEREAS a Foundation called and known as the \u201cKotasaraPiyangala Rajamaha Viharastha Development Society\u201d hasheretofore been established in Sri Lanka for the purpose ofeffectually carrying out and transacting all objects andmatters connected with the said Foundation according tothe rules agreed to by its members.\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Foundation has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the the several objectsand matters for which it was established and has applied tobe incorporated and it will be for the public advantage togrant the application.\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Kotasara PiyangalaRajamaha Viharastha Development Society (Incorporation)Act, No. of 2015."
  },
