    "md5": "184071150f499721227a0317cd978b18",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1991,
    "chunk_text": "BE it therefore, enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Seyyed Sheikh KoyaThangal Mowlana Foundation (Incorporation) Act, No. of2015.\n\nIncorporationof theSeyyedSheikh KoyaThangalMowlanaFoundation.\n\n2Seyyed Sheikh Koya Thangal Mowlana Foundation(Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be\u2014\n\n(a)to promote peace, goodwill, understanding andCooperation among all communities and people ofSri Lanka;\n\n(b)to establish thakkiyas, Arabic TheologicalColleges and Orphanages for boys;\n\n(c)to manage and run the institutions that are alreadyin existence such as Kattankudy MuhiyaddeenThakkiya, Kankeyanodai, Muhiyadeen Thakkiya(in Batticaloa District) Masjidur Riffaiyyi andArabic Theological College and Muslim Orpangethere is known as Madrasathul and Muslim Orpangein Kandy District;\n\n(d)to Manage the establishments and Institutions thathave been founded by Seyyed Sheikh Koya Thangalthe Predecessor of present Spiritual leader SeyyedMohamed Buhary Nalla Koya Thangal;\n\n(e)to promote the true creed of Islam as per SunnathulJamaath Doctrines;\n\n(f)to foster the spirit of unity and to promote goodwilland friendship among Muslims and othercommunities;\n\n(g)to organize public Religious Lectures on IslamicSubject;\n\n(h)to work for the Religious and secular Educationalcurricula for the welfare of the Muslims;\n\n(i)to organize Birthday and Anniversary celebrationof Holy Phopher (sal) and Corporatons and Savantsof Islam;30\n\nGeneralobjects of theCorporation.\n\n3Seyyed Sheikh Koya Thangal Mowlana Foundation(Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n(j)to promote social and cultural activities forenriching different and for integrating theSri Lankan communities;\n\n(k)to assist in the development of educational,Religious, cultural, aesthetic and sports facilitieswithout any reference to race, and to conduct variousfestival and competitions;"
