    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 46]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by the Minister of Justiceon 11th December, 2015\n\n(Published in the Gazette on November 09, 2015)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\n2-2d\n\n2-\n\nPrice : Rs. 3.00Postage : Rs. 10.00\n\nCODE OF CRIMINAL PROCEDURE (AMENDMENT)\n\nto amend the Code of Criminal Procedure Act, No. 15 of 1979\n\n2\u2014PL 009562\u2014475 (12/2015)\n\nSTATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT\n\nClause 2: This clause amends section 135 of the Code of Criminal Procedure Act, No. 15of 1979 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) by including section 291c ofthe Penal Code in paragraph (e) of subsection (1) thereof, and the legal effect of the sectionas amended is to make the Attorney General\u2019s sanction a pre-requisite to take cognizance ofan offence punishable under section 291C.\n\nClause 3 : This clause amends the First Schedule to the principal enactment and makesan amendment consequential to the amendment made by clause 2.\n\n1Code of Criminal Procedure(Amendment)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n2\u2014PL 009336\u2014425 (10/2015)\n\nShort title.\n\nL. D.\u2014O. 40/2015.\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE CODE OF CRIMINAL PROCEDUREACT, NO. 15 OF 1979\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Code of CriminalProcedure (Amendment) Act, No. of 2015.\n\n2.Section 135 of the Code of Criminal Procedure Act,No. 15 of 1979 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipalenactment\u201d) is hereby amended in paragraph (e) of subsection(1) of that section, by the substitution for the words andfigures \u201cany offence punishable under section 290A orsection 291B of the Penal Code\u201d, of the words and figures\u201cany offence punishable under section 290A , 291B or 291Cof the Penal Code\u201d."
