    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nTHE SERETSE KHAMA FOUNDATION TRUST(INCORPORATION)\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 39]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by Hon. Buddhika Pathirana, M.P. for Matara District on 08th December, 2015\n\n(Published in the Gazette on November 09, 2015)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\nto incorporate the Seretse Khama Foundation Trust\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA.\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5.\n\nPrice : Rs. 8.00Postage : Rs. 10.00\n\n2-2d\n\n2-\n\n2\u2014PL 009527\u2014225 (12/2015)\n\n1The Seretse Khama Foundation Trust(Incorporation)\n\n2\u2014PL 009314\u2014 300 (10/2015)\n\nPreamble.\n\nShort title.\n\nGeneralobjects of theCorporation.\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE SERETSE KHAMA FOUNDATION TRUST\n\nWHEREAS a trrust called and known as the \u201cThe SeretseKhama Foundation Trust\u201d has heretofore been ceated in SriLanka for the purpose of effectually carrying out andtransacting all objects and matters connected with the saidFoundation Trust:\n\nAND WHEREAS the Board of Trustees of the saidFoundation Trust has heretofore successfully carried outand transacted the several objects and matters for which thesaid Foundation Trust was created on 20th January 2006,and has applied to be incorporated, and it will be for thepublic advantage to grant the application :\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as The Seretse KhamaFoundation Trust (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2015."
