    "md5": "54ba1125ee147a40413127974d027fc3",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 2012,
    "chunk_text": "AND WHEREAS the Board of Trustees of the saidFoundation Trust has heretofore successfully carried outand transacted the several objects and matters for which thesaid Foundation Trust was created on 20th January 2006,and has applied to be incorporated, and it will be for thepublic advantage to grant the application :\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as The Seretse KhamaFoundation Trust (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2015.\n\n3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be\u2014\n\n(a)to perpetuate the memory of Sir SecretseKhama,the first President of Botswana and spread hismessage of peace and unity in Sri Lanka;\n\nIncorporationof the SeretseKhamaFoundation.\n\n30\n\n2The Seretse Khama Foundation Trust(Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n(b)to develop bilateral relations between Botswanaand Sri Lanka by promoting cultural, social andeconomic exchanges between the two countries;\n\n(c)to engage in activities for poor relief and theeradcation of poverty;\n\n(d)to provide financial assistance and to awardscholarships and bursaries to the deserving studentsto the University of Botswana and the Universityof Colombo;\n\n(e)to provide assistance and relief during the naturaldisasters;\n\n(f)to work toward the eliminiation of all termsdiscrimination amongst the people and uphold theRule of Law;\n\n(g)to support women and children for the upliftmentof their lives;\n\n(h)to establish and maintain youth hostels, medicalcentres and hospices;\n\n(i)to establish internet international communicationsand radio stations for disseminatio of knowledge;\n\n(j)to assist the government in its efforts to improvethe livings condition fo the people;\n\n(k)to engage in disaste relief and reconstruction;\n\n(l)to establish medical aid and legal aid schemes forthe welfare of people; and\n\n(m)to do all such other thisgs as may be necessary orconducive to the accomplishment of the objects ofthe Corporation."
