    "chunk_text": "2.From and after the date of commencement ofthis Act, such and so many persons as now are membersof the Sri Gunarathana International Foundation(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cFoundation\u201d) or shallhereafter be admitted as members of the Corporationhereby constituted, shall be a body corporate withperpetual succession, under the name and style of the\u201cSri Gunarathana International Foundation\u201d (hereinafterreferred to as the \u201cCorporation\u201d) and by that name may sueand be sued, with full power and authority to have and usea common seal and to alter the same at its pleasure.\n\n2Sri Gunarathana International Foundation(Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be\u2014\n\n(a)to take necessary action for the extension andprotection of Buddhism;\n\n(b)to assist in the establishment of Dhamma schools,to establish and conduct of centres for this purpose;\n\n(c)to take action for the conservation and theprotection of social values;\n\n(d)to establish institutions which are actively involvedin eradication social unrest;\n\n(e)to formulate systematic and effective programmesfor eradicating poverty;\n\n(f)to organize activites for the social welfare anddevelopment, using physical resources andknowledge which are inherent to Sri Lanka;\n\n(g)to promote mutual understanding and co-operationas social and national level in the human society;\n\n(h)to plan and implement community welfare,educational and social development projects inSri Lanka;\n\n(i)to promote education, health, recreation, cultureand agriculture, to provide grants, scholarships,gifts, donations and financial assistance for theimprovement, extension and publicize knowledgeand to establish institutions for this purpose;\n\n(j)to promote areas relating to traditional knowledgeand establish institutions for this purpose;\n\n(k)to commence and maintain projects for theprotection and conservation of the environment;\n\nGeneralobjects of theCorporation."
